              "value": "Primal Roar"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, eidolon)\n\nYour eidolon unleashes a primal roar or other such terrifying noise that fits your eidolon's form. Your eidolon attempts Intimidation checks to Demoralize each enemy that can hear the roar; these Demoralize attempts don't take any penalty for not sharing a language."
